以新羸兵置前，好兵在後，攻城之日。雲欲以羸兵填塹，使即時破，雖未能然，是事大趣也。私恐石陽城小，不能久留往兵，明使君速垂救濟，試宜疾密。王靖之變，其鑒不遠。今魴歸命，非復在天，正在明使君耳。若見救以往，則功可必成，如見救不時，則與靖等同禍。前彭綺時，聞旗麾在逢龍，此郡民大小歡喜，並思立效，若留一月日間，事當大成，恨去電速，東得增眾專力討綺，綺始敗耳。願使君深察此言。\"","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line080:m0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"潘濬","kind":"person","person_id":"pac_tt7_hs3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line080:m0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"王靖","kind":"person","person_id":"g73_fjc_s5n","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line080:m0127","start":127,"end":128,"surface":"魴","kind":"person","person_id":"iuc_mqu_3jm","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line080:m0163","start":163,"end":164,"surface":"靖","kind":"person","person_id":"g73_fjc_s5n","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line080:m0169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"彭綺","kind":"person","person_id":"fmk_v82_0t4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line080:m0217","start":217,"end":218,"surface":"綺","kind":"person","person_id":"fmk_v82_0t4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhoufang:line080:m0219","start":219,"end":220,"surface":"綺","kind":"person","person_id":"fmk_v82_0t4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":80,"last_line":80,"revision_id":2120830,"raw_start":7409,"raw_end":7642,"character_positions":[7409,7410,7411,7412,7413,7414,7415,7416,7417,7418,7419,7420,7421,7422,7423,7424,7425,7426,7427,7428,7429,7430,7431,7432,7433,7434,7435,7436,7437,7438,7439,7440,7441,7442,7443,7444,7445,7446,7447,7448,7449,7450,7451,7452,7453,7454